# Unanchored, so it also catches `crates/ply-codegen-spike/target/`: the spike
# is a separate cargo project outside the workspace, and an anchored `/target`
# put 387MB of its build output into the history in 2dd1d9b.
target/
/.claude/worktrees
.ply-cache/
# `examples/serve.sh`'s scratch project, including the certificate it generates.
examples/.serve/
benches/value-model/width-probe/target/
